{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_title", "source_sha256": "43e76ab51960e1dfaa9c4f682c4f8a4f364f4ae9efd34abb257865f9566bd2b3", "ja": "また会うために", "zh": "为了再次相遇", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a98c3a9f43c2fd777e3c00637600bed4a772487af4594204309fcf91855fa206", "ja": "オールスターライブのステージを終えて\n舞台袖でひと休みしたアイドル達は、\n声援に応えて再びステージへと向かう。\nまたいつか、出会う日のために。", "zh": "结束全明星演唱会的舞台后，\n在后台稍作休息的偶像们，\n为了回应欢呼声，再次走向舞台。\n为了将来某天再次相逢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eca37bd2b78bba5f97998a2ba869edc4a1edc70c58920897bccf891aa6895571", "ja": "（オールスターライブ『Destiny公演』は、\n熱狂と大声援に包まれる中、ひとまず幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（全明星演唱会的《Destiny公演》在热烈与欢呼声中暂时落下了帷幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8b8f185033eecfbbbf4fedabb47d19c93169e22a629ac0a72d164218c030918e", "ja": "（だが……）", "zh": "（但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "294b6a06be892625c81553ca6db9aa21b58c2c4ef3f26d94b0d21c2dd8e65372", "ja": "とりあえず、お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\n最後の一曲まで、しっかり歌いきりました。", "zh": "总之，辛苦了，{$P$}。\n直到最后一首歌，也好好地唱完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "90f8cdb7845e128aa69852d3d508bbfcf123dff536963d0d8c1e8ca8209c26b4", "ja": "でもまだ終われないんだよね～これが！\nほら、ファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達が待ってるし！", "zh": "不过还不能结束呢～因为还有这个！\n你看，粉丝哥哥姐姐们还在等着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1004_kansei", "source_sha256": "fd62ed9d0898007b94b31f8bb921ed1cfa3949e130f1da878dadb783003e73bc", "ja": "（アンコール！　アンコール！）", "zh": "（安可！安可！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bde7016e20f6f56e56f3386d3d580f910a65068277f27d222a64147de18a8b8c", "ja": "そうだな。準備ができ次第よろしく頼む。\n他のみんなは？", "zh": "是啊。准备好后就拜托了。  \n其他人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "9177be3d6aefbb6c6fc56854c9fd2ab3d2f4df79e057a739533beb3a07f2034c", "ja": "水分補給を。向こう側の舞台袖はかなり遠いので、\nもう何人か向かっています。", "zh": "补充一下水分。对面的舞台侧台距离相当远，已经有几个人先过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "8a7154a64225ff502e10a8df5dd4f200c62c3d4c6476579927fb7d4c2c44f96c", "ja": "亜美達はこっち側だから楽ちんだよね～。\n兄ちゃん、このスキに足とか揉んでくれていいんだよ？", "zh": "我们这边很轻松呢～  \n哥哥，趁这个机会帮我揉揉腿什么的也可以哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "169029e35fed50fd5e1b85bc8455afc15a01f091efdb0f419ce841cfe71bc235", "ja": "はは、亜美もさすがに疲れたのか？", "zh": "哈哈，亚美果然也累了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "135b4d62466e1aeb56464cf9de9082471c4f0a6c2b5ddb84a8dafbf3049c59a1", "ja": "ううん全然、これっぽっちも♪\nあと10曲ぐらいはヘッチャだよー！", "zh": "才没有呢，一点都不累♪\n再唱个10首左右也是小菜一碟啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "feaf5818fe544a0d0094426c41673ea1a0af7a0dbb4088751624e25718e20a0d", "ja": "ふふ、頼もしいわね。\nもちろん私も、歌い足りないけれど……。", "zh": "呵呵，真是可靠呢。\n当然，我也还没唱够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6bea701c212cf02ecc286ca6643e57323e02fa7a909a0b33c534d3ab95b644c2", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、そう思ってるんだよな。\nもっともっと続けてほしい、って。", "zh": "粉丝们也都是这么想的吧。  \n希望能继续，再继续下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0f39f2920a4e9bc30467d3e7c6b8fd4597a345807bc5a80e470215df3f1f4d9f", "ja": "でも本当は亜美も、皆も極限まで疲労してるんだ。\n今は気が張ってるから元気なだけだよ。", "zh": "但其实亚美和大家都已经疲惫到极限了。\n只是现在精神绷着，所以看起来还有精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "340d13c203a91c645e249593f3519b8eb22a657d2ba75b05fccffa4d5d927eb0", "ja": "だから元気なうちに、残りの力を全部出して\n今日という日をしっかり締めてきてくれ。", "zh": "所以趁你们还有精神，把剩下的力气全部拿出来，给今天画上一个圆满的句号吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b2562e9d0e3e4a0b68d49d26efb6e78457fd2a4938363fdacd7c93cb56388b15", "ja": "そしてしっかり休んで、元気を満タンにして、\nまた新しいステージで、みんなと巡り会おう！", "zh": "然后好好休息，把精神养到满格，\n下次在全新的舞台上，再和大家相逢吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "0ac7b5f28382ead2cc6f400789ad59563e4ebaf2420f9e245cc03388c862bb12", "ja": "……。はい！", "zh": "……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "eff4b1dbe9fea001fb2cdd56169990da05a9cf6a02ed749c3a7d9caedb7bfb75", "ja": "……。はーい！", "zh": "……。好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "e8b52adc22b0d05643bf55b143d2c123b73936d72513cfd335bdda728e525b82", "ja": "では、アンコールステージ、スタンバイします。\n行きましょう、亜美。", "zh": "那么，准备上返场舞台吧。\n走吧，亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "5e40bb39abc339a15eec7a8c3d360dc4882ca413cd0750156f24bc58dd6cc528", "ja": "うんっ。……ねぇ、千早お姉ちゃん。\nなんかアンコールのステージってさー。", "zh": "嗯！……那个，千早姐姐。\n总觉得安可舞台就像是——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "532e26c0a046b70f5b9de929799e2fd1e303403abe75c53eac4b965a41b29e9a", "ja": "「また会おうね」って、約束しにいくみたいだね！", "zh": "就像是去和大家约定“下次还要再见哦”一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "84a716ae7946b7f5ccdc7adde71bc3b86b308382efd126e96a2e5d4e91b0f383", "ja": "ふふっ、すごいわ亜美。\nきっと……その通りだと思う！", "zh": "呵呵，真厉害啊，亚美。\n我想……一定就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6d7c20c0049b2727889e46eff2f7ff1fbfd892a0e176b75acd25a689e82b8a75", "ja": "（今日という一日の出会いの終わりに、\nアイドル達は最後のステージへと向かっていく）", "zh": "（在与今天相遇的大家告别之际，偶像们走向最后的舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_epi01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1165c254c7be70a6d642c6c26509e30bb58639881401716f276639f8c5d4848c", "ja": "（……またいつかどこかで、巡り合うために！）", "zh": "（……为了将来有一天在某处再次相逢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
